	(text "The AMASS XT-30 R/A plugs/receptacles have a keyed and square side.\nMost connectors use the square side as positive for both the M/F housing.\nIf you look at the datasheet for both the XT30PW-M and XT30PW-F,\nyou'll notice that the left pin(1) has the square side for the male connector,\nand the left pin(also 1) has the KEYED side for the female connector.\nThis means the right pin(2) of the female connector needs to be POSITIVE(square),\nwhile the left pin(1) of the male connector needs to be positive(square) as well."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.246 35.052 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "514b49bf-f5e2-46d3-b679-a4f102768daa")
	)
